# reg-bio-3: operon-construct abuse — a transcription unit with thousands of
# cistrons. Membership lookups are linear per gate read, so a megacistron
# must stay bounded by the note cap / fuel contract (no hang, no OOM), and
# the final call must still answer with a bounded run.
gene c0() { return "c" }
